    "text": "David Vollrath, 1st District Commissioner | Berrien County\nDavid Vollrath, 1st District Commissioner | Berrien County\nWinter trail maintenance was completed on December 2, 2025, preparing the area for early season winter activities. According to the latest update, all trails have been rolled and packed, and a track has been set on the green cross-country ski loop.\nThe facility remains closed today but will offer equipment rentals tomorrow from 10 a.m. to 3 p.m.",
